#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "[Survival] The First Day of the Rest of their Unlives"
msgstr "[Выживание] Первый день конца их не-жизней"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '[Survival] The First Day of the Rest of their
#. Unlives'}
#: data/json/achievements.json
