msgid ""
"This a bodysuit with a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied to a "
"liquid coolant system, and a built-in thermometer.  It is currently working "
"to keep the entire body at an ideal temperature, use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"Это нательный костюм с несколькими радиаторами и нагревательными спиралями, "
