msgstr[3] "средний дождевик для четвероногих"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'medium quadruped rain sheet'}
#: data/json/items/armor/pets_medium_quadruped_armor.json
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering adapted for medium quadrupeds to protect from acid "
