msgstr[2] "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK"
msgstr[3] "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK"

#: data/json/items/gun/300BLK.json
msgid ""
"The IWI Tavor X95 (also called Micro-Tavor or MTAR) is an Israeli bullpup "
"assault rifle designed and produced by Israel Weapon Industries.  This is "
"the civilian version chambered for .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr ""
"IWI Tavor X95 (также известная как Micro-Tavor или MTAR) — израильская "
"штурмовая винтовка по схеме булл-пап, разработанная и произведенная "
"компанией  Israel Weapon Industries. Это гражданская модель под патрон .300 "
"AAC Blackout."

#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
