#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Eye color: red"
msgstr "Цвет глаз: красный"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Eye color: red'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have incredibly rare red eyes."
msgstr "У вас невероятно редкие красные глаза."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Eye color: violet"
msgstr "Цвет глаз: фиолетовый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Eye color: violet'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have incredibly rare violet eyes."
msgstr "У вас невероятно редкие фиолетовые глаза."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: dark brown"
msgstr "Цвет кожи: тёмно-коричневый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skin tone: dark brown'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a dark brown skin tone."
msgstr "Ваша кожа тёмно-коричневого цвета."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: light"
msgstr "Цвет кожи: светлый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skin tone: light'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a light peach skin tone."
msgstr "Ваша кожа светло-персикового цвета."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: light brown"
msgstr "Цвет кожи: светло-коричневый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skin tone: light brown'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a light brown skin tone."
msgstr "Ваша кожа светло-коричневого цвета."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: rose"
msgstr "Цвет кожи: розовый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skin tone: rose'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a rosy pink skin tone."
msgstr "Ваша кожа розового цвета."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Skin tone: bronze"
msgstr "Цвет кожи: бронзовый"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skin tone: bronze'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a bronze or tan skin tone."
msgstr "Ваша кожа цвета бронзы или загара."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: none"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: нет"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: none'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have no hair on your face, it is shaven or simply untouched by the "
"presence of hair."
msgstr ""
"На вашем лице нет растительности, оно гладко выбрито или просто лишено "
"волос."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: goatee"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: козлиная бородка"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: goatee'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a short beard at the tip of your chin."
msgstr "У вас короткая борода на кончике подбородка."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: circle beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: круговая борода"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: circle beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard, that both form a circle around your "
"lips."
msgstr "У вас усы и короткая борода, образующие круг вокруг губ."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: royale beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода ройал"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: royale beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard forming a patch under your lips."
msgstr "У вас усы и короткая борода под губами."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: anchor beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода якорь"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: anchor beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a beard starting with a strip going down from the "
"bottom lip, then tracing the jaw lines.  It looks a bit like an anchor, thus"
" the name."
msgstr ""
"У вас усы и борода, начинающаяся полоской под нижней губой и продолжающаяся "
"по линии нижней челюсти. Похожа на якорь, поэтому так и называется."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: short boxed beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода короб"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: short boxed beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a short beard with trimmed sides.  Thin patches "
"connect them both, forming a 'box' around the lips, thus the name."
msgstr ""
"У вас усы и короткая борода с подровненными краями. Их соединяют короткие "
"участки, образуя «рамку» вокруг губ, отсюда и название."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: chevron moustache"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: усы шеврон"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: chevron moustache'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a moustache that covers your entire top lip."
msgstr "Ваши усы полностью закрывают верхнюю губу."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: 3-day stubble"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: трёхдневная щетина"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: 3-day stubble'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a short trimmed moustache and beard imitating a 3-day stubble."
msgstr ""
"У вас коротко подрезанные усы и борода, напоминающие трёхдневную щетину."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: horseshoe"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: подкова"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: horseshoe'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache with patches going down the chin from both ends, thus "
"the name."
msgstr "Ваши усы спускаются к подбородку с обеих сторон, отсюда и название."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: original moustache"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: природные усы"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: original moustache'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache with shortened ends, that covers only the skin above "
"your upper lip."
msgstr ""
"У вас усы с укороченными краями, закрывающие только кожу над верхней губой."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: mutton chops beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода баранья отбивная"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: mutton chops beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have long sideburns that connect to your moustache, with the tip of the "
"chin shaven clean."
msgstr ""
"У вас длинные бакенбарды, соединяющиеся с усами, края нижней челюсти гладко "
"выбриты."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: gunslinger beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода стрелка"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: gunslinger beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a horseshoe moustache and disconnected sideburns."
msgstr "У вас борода-подкова и не соединённые с ней бакенбарды."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: chin strip"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: полоска на подбородке"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: chin strip'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a short beard in a form of a vertical patch under your bottom lip."
msgstr "У вас короткая борода в виде вертикальной полоски под нижней губой."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: chin curtain"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода ширма"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: chin curtain'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a full beard without a moustache, restricted to the chin, sometimes"
" called a 'lion's mane'. Much like Abraham Lincoln's beard."
msgstr ""
"У вас нет усов и длинная борода по краю нижней челюсти, иногда её называют "
"«львиная грива». Похожа на бороду Авраама Линкольна."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: chin strap"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: шкиперская борода"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: chin strap'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a beard along the jaw lines, circling the chin, and no moustache."
msgstr ""
"У вас есть борода вдоль челюстных линий, огибающая подбородок, и нет усов."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: beard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: beard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a moustache and a long beard, both formed by allowing free growth "
"of hair, with no particular styling."
msgstr ""
"У вас усы и длинная борода из естественно растущих волос без какой-либо "
"стрижки."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: handlebar moustache"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: усы велосипедный руль"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: handlebar moustache'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a moustache with long flared out ends."
msgstr "У вас усы с длинными завёрнутыми кончиками."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: neckbeard"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: шейная борода"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: neckbeard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a beard formed from hair grown on neck below the chin line.  No "
"moustache included."
msgstr "У вас борода из волос, растущих на шее под нижней челюстью. Усов нет."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: pencil moustache"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: усы карандаш"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: pencil moustache'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a very thin moustache just above the line of the upper lip."
msgstr "У вас очень тонкие усы сразу над краем верхней губы."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: shenandoah"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: шенандоа"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: shenandoah'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a long full beard with no moustache, popular among Amish community,"
" often with two pointed ends."
msgstr ""
"У вас длинная густая борода без усов, популярная в общине амишей, зачастую с"
" двумя заострёнными концами."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: sideburns"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: бакенбарды"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: sideburns'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have patches of hair in front of your ears, that normally would connect "
"your hair with the beard, but they are here by themselves."
msgstr ""
"У вас полоски волос спереди от ушей, обычно они соединяют причёску с "
"бородой, но сейчас они сами по себе."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: soul patch"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: борода островок"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: soul patch'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a little bit of hair in the dip under your lower lip, and no other "
"facial hair whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"У вас немного волос в ямке под нижней губой и никакой другой растительности "
"на лице."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: toothbrush moustache"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: усы щёточкой"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: toothbrush moustache'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"Charlie Chaplin used to have this short patch of hair just under the nose, "
"but then that other guy used it as a characteristic, and it became "
"unwelcomed."
msgstr ""
"Такой короткий клочок волос сразу под носом был у Чарли Чаплина, но потом их"
" как особенность носил другой мужик, так что эти усы непопулярны."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: Van Dyke"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: Ван Дайк"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: Van Dyke'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "You have a handlebar moustache with a chin strip or a small goatee."
msgstr ""
"У вас \"рулевые\" усы с подбородочной полоской или небольшая козлиная "
"бородка."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: walrus"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: морж"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: walrus'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a long thick moustache, overshadowing your lips, that somewhat "
"resembles the facial hair of a walrus."
msgstr ""
"У вас длинные густые усы, заслоняющие губы, которые несколько напоминают "
"волосы на лице моржа."

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid "Facial hair: The Zappa"
msgstr "Растительность на лице: Заппа"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Facial hair: The Zappa'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_appearance.json
msgid ""
"You have a wide soul patch and a full moustache that extends a bit downwards"
" at the corners of your lips."
msgstr ""
"У вас широкий островок и большие усы, спускающиеся немного ниже уголков губ."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json src/creature.cpp src/options.cpp
msgid "Any"
msgstr "Любые"

#. ~ Mutation class: Any mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You feel strange."
msgstr "Вы странно себя чувствуете."

#. ~ Mutation class: Any iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You inject yourself."
msgstr "Вы делаете себе инъекцию."

#. ~ Mutation class: Any junkie_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You quiver with anticipation..."
msgstr "Вы дрожите от нетерпения…"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Plant"
msgstr "Растение"

#. ~ Mutation class: Plant mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Dryad mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel much closer to nature."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете себя гораздо ближе к природе."

#. ~ Mutation class: Plant iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Dryad iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You inject some nutrients into your phloem."
msgstr "Вы вводите питательные вещества в вашу флоэму."

#. ~ Mutation class: Plant Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Dryad Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Bloomed forth."
msgstr "Расцвёл."

#. ~ Mutation class: Plant Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Dryad Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Bloomed forth."
msgstr "Расцвела."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect"
msgstr "Насекомое"

#. ~ Mutation class: Insect mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You hear buzzing, and feel your body harden."
msgstr "Вы слышите жужжание и чувствуете, как ваше тело твердеет."

#. ~ Mutation class: Insect iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You sting yourself… for the Queen."
msgstr "Вы ужалили себя… За Королеву."

#. ~ Mutation class: Insect Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Metamorphosed."
msgstr "Подвергнулся метаморфозе."

#. ~ Mutation class: Insect Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Metamorphosed."
msgstr "Подверглась метаморфозе."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Spider"
msgstr "Паук"

#. ~ Mutation class: Spider mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Arachnae mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel insidious."
msgstr "В вас просыпается коварство."

#. ~ Mutation class: Spider iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Arachnae iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Mmm… the *special* venom."
msgstr "Ммм… *Особый* яд."

#. ~ Mutation class: Spider Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Arachnae Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Found a place in the web of life."
msgstr "Нашёл место в паутине жизни."

#. ~ Mutation class: Spider Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Arachnae Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Found a place in the web of life."
msgstr "Нашла место в паутине жизни."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/thresh_mutation.json
msgid "Slime"
msgstr "Слизь"

#. ~ Mutation class: Slime mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Your body loses all rigidity for a moment."
msgstr "Ваше тело теряет всю жёсткость на мгновение."

#. ~ Mutation class: Slime iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "This stuff takes you back.  Downright primordial!"
msgstr "Эта штука несёт вас назад. Прямо в первобытность!"

#. ~ Mutation class: Slime junkie_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Maybe if you drank enough, you'd become mutagen..."
msgstr "Возможно, если вы достаточно выпьете, вы сами станете мутагеном…"

#. ~ Mutation class: Slime Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Gave up on rigid human norms."
msgstr "Отказался от строгих человеческих норм."

#. ~ Mutation class: Slime Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Gave up on rigid human norms."
msgstr "Отказалась от строгих человеческих норм."

#. ~ Mutation class: Fish mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You are overcome by an overwhelming longing for the ocean."
msgstr "Вы подавляете нахлынувшее чувство тоски по океану."

#. ~ Mutation class: Fish iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Your pulse pounds as the waves."
msgstr "Ваш пульс стучит волнами."

#. ~ Mutation class: Fish Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Went deep."
msgstr "Ушёл на дно."

#. ~ Mutation class: Fish Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Went deep."
msgstr "Ушла на дно."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Rat"
msgstr "Крыса"

#. ~ Mutation class: Rat mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You feel a momentary nausea."
msgstr "Вы чувствуете мимолётную тошноту."

#. ~ Mutation class: Rat iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "You squeak as the shot hits you."
msgstr "Вы пищите, когда игла вонзается в ваше тело."

#. ~ Mutation class: Rat iv_sound_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "eep!"
msgstr "«Ооп!»"

#. ~ Mutation class: Rat Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Found that survival *is* everything."
msgstr "Обнаружил, что выживание *это* всё."

#. ~ Mutation class: Rat Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Found that survival *is* everything."
msgstr "Обнаружила, что выживание *это* всё."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Beast"
msgstr "Зверь"

#. ~ Mutation class: Beast mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Your heart races and you see blood for a moment."
msgstr ""
"Ваше сердцебиение ускоряется, и на мгновение ваши глаза наливаются кровью."

#. ~ Mutation class: Beast iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Your heart races wildly as the injection takes hold."
msgstr "Ваш сердечный ритм дико ускоряется после инъекции."

#. ~ Mutation class: Beast Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Embraced his bestial nature."
msgstr "Принял свою звериную натуру."

#. ~ Mutation class: Beast Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Embraced his bestial nature."
msgstr "Приняла свою звериную натуру."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bear"
msgstr "Медведь"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel an urge to… patrol?  the forests?"
msgstr "Вы чувствуете сильное желание… Патрулировать? Лес?"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel yourself quite equipped for wilderness survival."
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете себя достаточно подготовленным для выживания в дикой природе."

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Became one with the bears."
msgstr "Стал единым с медведями."

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Became one with the bears."
msgstr "Стала единым с медведями."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feline"
msgstr "Кошка"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "As you lap up the last of the mutagen, you wonder why..."
msgstr ""
"Когда вы лакаете последние капли мутагена, вы удивляетесь, зачем вы это "
"делаете…"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Your back arches as the mutagen takes hold."
msgstr "Ваша спина изгибается дугой после приёма мутагена."

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Realized the dream."
msgstr "Осуществил мечту."

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Realized the dream."
msgstr "Осуществила мечту."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wolf"
msgstr "Волк"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wolf mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Inumimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel an urge to mark your territory.  But then it passes."
msgstr ""
"Вы чувствуете сильное желание пометить вашу территорию. Но это проходит."

#. ~ Mutation class: Wolf iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Inumimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "As the mutagen hits you, your ears twitch and you stifle a yipe."
msgstr ""
"Когда вы вкалываете себе мутаген, ваши уши дёргаются, и вы сдерживаете "
"скулёж."

#. ~ Mutation class: Wolf Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Wolfed out."
msgstr "Оволчился."

#. ~ Mutation class: Wolf Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Wolfed out."
msgstr "Оволчилась."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Cattle"
msgstr "Скот"

#. ~ Mutation class: Cattle mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Ushimimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Your mind and body slow down.  You feel peaceful."
msgstr "Ваш разум и тело успокаиваются. Вы чувствуете умиротворение."

#. ~ Mutation class: Cattle iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Ushimimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You wonder if this is what rBGH feels like..."
msgstr "Интересно, похоже ли это на коровий гормон роста…"

#. ~ Mutation class: Cattle Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Ushimimi Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Stopped worrying and learned to love the cowbell."
msgstr "Перестал беспокоиться и полюбил колокольчик для скота."

#. ~ Mutation class: Cattle Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Ushimimi Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Stopped worrying and learned to love the cowbell."
msgstr "Перестала беспокоиться и полюбила колокольчик для скота."

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cephalopod"
msgstr "Головоногое"

#. ~ Mutation class: Cephalopod mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
