#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'qualitative filter paper'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"filter paper for seperating solids from liquids.  This filter paper has a "
"rating of 2 microns, seperating more solids out than quantitative filter "
"paper but the process takes longer."
msgstr ""
"Фильтровальная бумага для отделения твердых веществ от жидкостей. У этой "
