#. ~ Description for Holy Blade
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A broadsword made out of concentrated magical light and glowing with holy "
"power.  Let your blade cleave through these unholy monsters!"
msgstr ""
